WEBVTT

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:42.650
So, right when you meet an unexpected enemy,

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:45.280
rather than defeating him,

00:01:45.280 --> 00:01:51.920
you must first focus on protecting your own body...

00:01:47.820 --> 00:01:49.420
Hey... Who's that guy?

00:01:49.430 --> 00:01:51.920
Beats me. Could he be a new teacher?

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:54.740
Don't you know that he's Takechi-sensei?

00:01:54.740 --> 00:01:56.330
Huh... That's him?

00:01:56.330 --> 00:02:00.690
But isn't Takechi-sensei an expert of disguise who doesn't show his true face...?

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:03.900
Marikouji-sensei, do you have any questions?

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:05.710
No! Not at all...

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:10.580
Then please stay here and take care of the luggage.

00:02:10.590 --> 00:02:12.450
I... have to take care of the luggage?

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:14.910
All of you, scatter!

00:02:14.930 --> 00:02:17.950
Yes...

00:02:18.430 --> 00:02:22.950
In spite of what happened to the boys' school, they act like nothing happened.

00:02:29.210 --> 00:02:32.800
Which reminds me, I didn't see Shikimi-chan...

00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:35.970
She's gone to search for some weird herbs by herself again.

00:02:35.970 --> 00:02:37.600
No, no, no, need to worry.

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:42.440
What is this?! I haven't seen this plant before...

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:52.680
What... is this?

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:55.590
Who's there?!

00:03:00.520 --> 00:03:02.570
Your skill isn't so great.

00:03:05.210 --> 00:03:06.600
Damn.

00:03:06.970 --> 00:03:08.700
This braid belongs to...

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:10.070
Nanafushi!

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:28.090
There's no way we can find any weird herbs...

00:03:28.970 --> 00:03:30.240
Shikimi-san!

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:33.590
Any discoveries?

00:03:33.610 --> 00:03:35.150
Anything such as overly radical herbs?

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:39.400
Shikimi-san, this herb... I've never seen it before-

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:39.900
Huh?

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:55.020
This dirty and scary thing...

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:57.750
What is it?

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:03.190
It even walked here by itself.

00:04:08.090 --> 00:04:08.890
What's up?

00:04:08.900 --> 00:04:09.670
What's the matter?

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:13.800
My heart gets excited whenever I hear the sound of explosions!

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:14.660
What happened?

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:21.140
According to my information, this is a children's firecracker sold by the candy shop in town.

00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:26.140
By the way, this month's special at the shop is Momotaro's millet dumplings.

00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:28.640
I wonder whose joke this is...

00:04:29.610 --> 00:04:30.680
What's wrong?

00:04:34.860 --> 00:04:38.020
Someone who shouldn't have been here, appeared, then vanished again.

00:04:38.020 --> 00:04:40.130
Is that a riddle?

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:43.950
Shikimi-san, is there anything wrong?

00:04:44.940 --> 00:04:46.170
Nothing.

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:50.070
But today, you're acting weird.

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:00.440
That's...

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:03.110
Nanafushi's property.

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:05.600
The ninja who attacked me in the mountains used this.

00:05:05.600 --> 00:05:07.250
The one who attacked Shikimi-san...

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:09.320
There's no way it could be Nanafushi-san!

00:05:09.320 --> 00:05:13.420
There's no way for him to attack someone he cares about.

00:05:09.320 --> 00:05:13.410
Translator's note: The tanchoudzuru (Japanese Crane) is an endangered species of bird, which would rather be preserved than attacked.

00:05:13.430 --> 00:05:16.640
It's not like I'm someone he cares about...

00:05:17.530 --> 00:05:20.970
We could assume that somebody snatched Nanafushi's kunai too.

00:05:17.530 --> 00:05:20.970
Note: "Kunai" literally means <i>Ninja throwing knife</i>.
It is the standard weapon used by ninjas.

00:05:35.470 --> 00:05:37.390
The scent of a fine man.

00:05:37.950 --> 00:05:39.950
He's close by, very close.

00:05:39.950 --> 00:05:42.290
I won't let you go.

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:45.460
Men are meant to go with sake.

00:05:50.590 --> 00:05:53.070
He might still be around.

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:57.400
I'm starving...

00:05:57.710 --> 00:06:01.370
I wonder if I should continue this kind of life...

00:06:02.280 --> 00:06:04.880
T-This is...!

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:11.620
Let's eat!

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:16.850
Delicious! It's very filling.

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:22.280
What a long day.

00:06:39.840 --> 00:06:43.820
WHAT THE HELL IS THIS?!

00:06:48.520 --> 00:06:50.450
What's with his head?

00:06:51.460 --> 00:06:53.980
Well then, I will take the attendance.

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:58.460
It's human nature to want to see what's hidden!

00:06:58.460 --> 00:06:59.530
Stop it!

00:06:59.550 --> 00:07:01.030
It's just messy hair.

00:07:01.030 --> 00:07:02.470
Cut it out! H-Hey!

00:07:02.630 --> 00:07:03.700
Got it!

00:07:13.480 --> 00:07:16.580
Hayato-dono! Grass is growing from your head!

00:07:17.180 --> 00:07:18.120
This plant...

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:19.390
Ouch!

00:07:19.390 --> 00:07:22.590
Why is the plant from my room in a place like this?

00:07:22.590 --> 00:07:23.620
I don't know.

00:07:24.430 --> 00:07:29.690
I got it, boiled it, made a salad and ate it...
And this is what became of me...

00:07:29.690 --> 00:07:33.330
Was it so delicious? Besides, it grows on your head.

00:07:33.350 --> 00:07:35.520
So you won't have to worry about food from now on, right?

00:07:35.520 --> 00:07:37.630
Vegetables are healthy!

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:39.700
Isn't that something good?

00:07:39.720 --> 00:07:43.240
Everyone! This isn't the time to say such light-hearted things.

00:07:43.260 --> 00:07:48.250
It grew to this extent in just one night? It's quite poisonous.

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:49.780
Where is its stump?

00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:50.990
It's in my room but...

00:07:58.840 --> 00:08:00.080
Kill.

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:09.500
Why are you after Shikimi?

00:08:09.940 --> 00:08:13.540
Besides that, why is a ninja from the boys' school here?

00:08:13.540 --> 00:08:15.010
Everyone should have been caught...

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:18.480
As I thought, you're a spy from the organization!

00:08:18.480 --> 00:08:19.780
Nanafushi!

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:22.980
Shikimi.

00:08:33.960 --> 00:08:37.730
What do you mean by this thing being a spy from the organization?

00:08:37.970 --> 00:08:42.130
Do you think that he's involved with blowing up the the boys' school?

00:08:42.140 --> 00:08:45.240
I'm not really sure,

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:48.740
but there's a horrible plan that's been carried out without our knowledge.

00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:51.140
A horrible plan?

00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:53.160
What about the male students?

00:08:53.700 --> 00:08:56.910
That night when we had the welcome party,

00:08:57.570 --> 00:09:00.690
I was late to the party due to picking herbs.

00:09:03.230 --> 00:09:05.760
The drinks were laced with tranquilizers.

00:09:06.290 --> 00:09:07.460
Get a hold of yourself!

00:09:07.460 --> 00:09:10.020
Then, in the night, they finally came.

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:19.170
The students were being taken somewhere and I escaped alone.

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:25.910
A powerful organization kidnapped the boys,

00:09:25.930 --> 00:09:28.380
and is now targeting Shikimi, as well as you girls.

00:09:28.390 --> 00:09:29.780
Because of that, the one here...

00:09:29.780 --> 00:09:32.320
I am thinking of... What's that?!

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:35.750
It's about time for the poison to be spread around.

00:09:36.530 --> 00:09:39.680
Actually I meant to target that girl over there. But...

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:40.260
Poison?

00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:43.070
If it's Shikimi-san, who's interested in herbs,

00:09:43.070 --> 00:09:45.300
she'd definitely put a leaf into her mouth.

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:47.500
Then she'll be under my control.

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:48.670
What do you mean?

00:09:48.680 --> 00:09:49.770
These leaves are...

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:54.280
Editor's note: Cordyceps is a family of parasitic fungi.

00:09:50.250 --> 00:09:54.280
Like cordyceps, it grows by absorbing its host as nutrient.

00:09:55.370 --> 00:10:00.340
But since it's him who ate it, the plan backfired.

00:10:00.360 --> 00:10:02.610
Then, why are you just fine?

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:04.720
Hayato-dono, your hands!

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:05.460
Huh?!

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:08.920
Even though it looked like it was going smoothly,

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:10.250
this unnecessary hindrance is...

00:10:10.260 --> 00:10:11.360
Nanafushi.

00:10:11.370 --> 00:10:11.930
Shikimi.

00:10:21.730 --> 00:10:22.440
Shikimi-san!

00:10:28.880 --> 00:10:30.610
W-Why?

00:10:30.610 --> 00:10:32.380
Yes. That time...

00:10:38.980 --> 00:10:41.150
Then... You ate it?

00:10:41.150 --> 00:10:42.920
If I was more careful.

00:10:42.940 --> 00:10:45.020
Nanafushi was trying to save me.

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:49.030
When I found it in the mountains...

00:10:50.860 --> 00:10:52.800
When the thing appeared in the room...

00:10:53.620 --> 00:10:56.470
You distracted me, and tried to keep me away from it.

00:10:56.470 --> 00:10:57.600
Didn't you?

00:10:57.620 --> 00:11:00.200
But I couldn't protect you in the end.

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:04.270
Hayato-dono!

00:11:04.280 --> 00:11:06.210
It's even bigger than before.

00:11:06.210 --> 00:11:08.650
At such pace, it will only be one more day...

00:11:08.660 --> 00:11:12.080
Please tell us how to return them back to normal.

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:14.280
Besides Hayato, what will Shikimi become?

00:11:19.640 --> 00:11:20.860
Shikimi-san!

00:11:21.340 --> 00:11:25.130
Once it starts growing, it will grow even faster.

00:11:25.130 --> 00:11:26.160
Half a day more...

00:11:26.170 --> 00:11:28.960
I'll slice you up!

00:11:36.230 --> 00:11:37.280
It's gone.

00:11:37.290 --> 00:11:38.340
That's a grass-ninja.

00:11:39.150 --> 00:11:40.570
It escaped underground.

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:45.520
This isn't the time to be impressed. Look, we have to go after it.

00:11:45.530 --> 00:11:47.420
It's no use even if we chase it.

00:11:47.690 --> 00:11:51.220
It just wants to brag about what it knows.

00:11:51.220 --> 00:11:55.430
If it knows the antidote, then it surely would have left some hints.

00:11:55.790 --> 00:11:57.760
Shikimi, are you all right?

00:11:57.780 --> 00:12:01.300
Nanafushi-san knows a lot about herbs, right?

00:12:01.300 --> 00:12:04.870
Then isn't there a way to somehow get them back to normal?

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:05.970
I don't know.

00:12:05.980 --> 00:12:07.940
I haven't seen this plant before either.

00:12:08.650 --> 00:12:12.950
If that's the case, we have to test each and every antidote we know of.

00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:16.450
But, if we miss one step, it could take your life.

00:12:17.020 --> 00:12:21.950
I would like to bet on a faint hope rather than living as a plant.

00:12:23.430 --> 00:12:24.790
I understand.

00:12:25.380 --> 00:12:28.560
Hey Shikimi, aren't you the one who's going to do it?

00:12:29.130 --> 00:12:31.560
H-Hey, wait a minute!

00:12:29.300 --> 00:12:31.560
Stay quiet, Hayato.

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:35.050
Fight poison with poison.

00:12:35.660 --> 00:12:38.840
It's do-or-die, but this is our last chance.

00:12:38.850 --> 00:12:42.070
Listen, I won't drink that.

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:43.370
Ah, a UFO!

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:44.670
Where?

00:12:46.600 --> 00:12:48.350
Hayato-dono!

00:12:48.840 --> 00:12:50.310
Where did he go?

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:53.630
Just like a chameleon we can't tell him apart from the trees.

00:12:55.970 --> 00:12:56.960
Go, Momota.

00:13:08.240 --> 00:13:10.200
Am I the poison-tester for Shikimi?

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:11.870
That might be, but...

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:13.340
Really?

00:13:13.340 --> 00:13:17.040
We want you to be the tester, because your condition is more serious.

00:13:17.060 --> 00:13:17.710
That's right.

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:22.750
When all of your cells have been taken over by the plant, you will lose consciousness.

00:13:22.760 --> 00:13:26.950
We have to do something before that, but just in this case...

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:28.990
This time I will test the poison first.

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:31.520
What will happen after you drink it?

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:35.660
But... But if we don't act quickly...

00:13:35.670 --> 00:13:37.460
Let's go to "The Rat's Stomach."

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:38.560
"The Rat's Stomach"?

00:13:38.570 --> 00:13:39.770
That's dangerous.

00:13:39.780 --> 00:13:42.500
What is it? Tell me!

00:13:43.110 --> 00:13:45.240
It's a cave at Houdan Mountain.

00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:48.910
It's shaped like a rat's stomach, that why it's called that.

00:13:48.920 --> 00:13:50.780
Inside it's just like a maze.

00:13:50.790 --> 00:13:53.440
It's been said that once you enter, you'll never get out.

00:13:53.440 --> 00:13:57.240
But the kuchiari grass blooming there seems to be able to cure any poison.

00:13:57.580 --> 00:13:59.950
Then, I will go get it.

00:13:59.950 --> 00:14:01.630
No, I'll go.

00:14:03.180 --> 00:14:05.160
You reap what you sow.

00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:07.530
I can't involve those unaffected.

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:09.290
The ones that should go are Hayato and me.

00:14:09.290 --> 00:14:09.760
Me too?

00:14:10.290 --> 00:14:12.500
Am I unaffected?

00:14:12.750 --> 00:14:16.070
Whether you are affected or not, it's not important now!

00:14:16.070 --> 00:14:17.910
Wait, what are you talking about?

00:14:18.590 --> 00:14:21.220
That's why I said it, anyway,

00:14:22.080 --> 00:14:23.410
I will go!

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:26.040
That's right. Isn't it better if we all go?

00:14:26.060 --> 00:14:27.110
Since it looks like fun.

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:28.910
That's it.

00:14:32.500 --> 00:14:33.150
Shikimi!

00:14:33.150 --> 00:14:34.410
Shikimi-chan!

00:14:53.540 --> 00:14:55.580
This is the entrance of "The Rat's Stomach."

00:14:56.230 --> 00:14:56.820
Let's go.

00:14:57.740 --> 00:15:01.250
At such times, it's smart to use a red thread to mark the way...

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:06.820
Denzou-san said that in the 33rd installment of The Shinobis, "The Legend of the Useful Red Thread."

00:15:10.140 --> 00:15:11.200
This way.

00:15:16.460 --> 00:15:18.730
We've come back to the same place.

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:23.500
What's wrong?

00:15:24.010 --> 00:15:25.900
I hear the sound of water.

00:15:25.920 --> 00:15:29.240
Plants have to grow where there's water.

00:15:30.060 --> 00:15:32.670
We'll be there if we follow that sound.

00:15:32.670 --> 00:15:34.680
I'll make a shortcut.

00:15:35.040 --> 00:15:36.680
Himeji, NO!

00:15:36.680 --> 00:15:37.460
NO!

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:44.390
If we move in 3 dimensions instead of 2, then it will no longer be a maze.

00:15:44.390 --> 00:15:45.590
All right. The path's clear.

00:15:45.610 --> 00:15:46.360
Let's go.

00:15:46.360 --> 00:15:48.530
I'm a genius!

00:16:00.700 --> 00:16:01.920
Just a bit more.

00:16:05.140 --> 00:16:06.040
It's kuchiari grass.

00:16:06.060 --> 00:16:08.380
Really! We've done it. We're saved!

00:16:08.370 --> 00:16:14.020
Editor's note: "Kuchi" means "mouth."

00:16:11.670 --> 00:16:14.020
U-Um. Should I really eat this?

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:17.120
Hayato-dono, there's no other choice now.

00:16:17.130 --> 00:16:18.890
So, I will test for poison.

00:16:18.890 --> 00:16:19.930
It's fine.

00:16:19.930 --> 00:16:24.390
I'll eat it, if it can turn me back to normal...

00:16:24.390 --> 00:16:26.260
No~

00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:43.090
Nothing... happened. Did it?

00:16:44.010 --> 00:16:45.560
I will try it.

00:16:51.390 --> 00:16:54.330
Looks like it's not going to work.

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:56.430
What's this all about?

00:17:02.420 --> 00:17:05.440
The stalactites above the grass...

00:17:05.440 --> 00:17:07.130
...are all broken.

00:17:07.620 --> 00:17:10.140
What happened to them?

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:17.230
A stalactite will form after thousands of years by dissolving the contents of rocks that form this cave,

00:17:17.230 --> 00:17:20.920
and the kuchiari grass also grow from this water.

00:17:20.940 --> 00:17:23.650
It's the reason why it's called the best antidote.

00:17:23.670 --> 00:17:26.660
In other words, there's no other way around?

00:17:26.670 --> 00:17:28.800
You've got to be kidding me.

00:17:32.520 --> 00:17:36.030
Huh? What's everybody doing, gathering here?

00:17:36.370 --> 00:17:37.650
Monjaya's...

00:17:37.650 --> 00:17:39.070
Mansaku-san...

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:40.800
You too, what are you doing?

00:17:41.350 --> 00:17:43.710
Eh, me? Look...

00:17:43.710 --> 00:17:49.090
I'm breaking the pillars of the limestone cave, to put them into my okonomiyaki.

00:17:43.710 --> 00:17:49.090
Editor's note: Okonomiyaki is a Japanese dish of fried/grilled batter cake with various ingredients.

00:17:49.090 --> 00:17:53.600
I'm thinking of calling it, "Phantom Limestone Cave Mix"...

00:17:54.650 --> 00:17:57.890
Mansaku-san, that idiot!

00:17:57.890 --> 00:17:59.160
Idiot!

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:08.760
I've looked up the data on the five students that you marked,

00:18:09.380 --> 00:18:12.170
but only the data on Hinata Himawari is inaccessible.

00:18:12.180 --> 00:18:17.270
Besides that, the data on the teacher named Marikouji Hayato is also guarded.

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:24.750
Most likely the information on those two is kept hidden from civilians for their protection.

00:18:24.760 --> 00:18:25.780
I see.

00:18:26.220 --> 00:18:31.490
Compared to the four others, I don't think they're as threatening.

00:18:31.490 --> 00:18:34.980
If you say so.

00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:37.260
Tsukiyohime-san!

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:50.980
I couldn't find her then either...

00:18:50.980 --> 00:18:52.970
That's not the case.

00:18:53.490 --> 00:18:54.490
Tsukiyohime-san.

00:18:55.180 --> 00:18:58.750
But... I'm afraid I won't meet your expectations.

00:19:02.720 --> 00:19:09.990
Since you are born Japanese, I think you would like to eat white rice, miso soup, and pickles at the end.

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:14.200
The last supper?

00:19:14.200 --> 00:19:15.490
Let's eat.

00:19:16.030 --> 00:19:20.000
Note: Nattou is a traditional Japanese dish made from fermented soybeans.

00:19:16.040 --> 00:19:20.010
I can refill the miso soup as much as you want. There's also nattou.

00:19:26.270 --> 00:19:28.010
Refill miso soup.

00:19:28.380 --> 00:19:29.870
It's delicious.

00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:34.110
If I had such a delicious meal and miso soup back then,

00:19:34.110 --> 00:19:36.590
I wouldn't have eaten that strange plant.

00:19:37.030 --> 00:19:38.590
Hayato-dono.

00:19:40.830 --> 00:19:42.090
Himawari.

00:19:42.380 --> 00:19:46.430
Thank you for choosing this good-for-nothing master.

00:19:46.440 --> 00:19:47.460
Sort of.

00:19:47.460 --> 00:19:51.100
I sure say embarassing things when I think the end is near.

00:19:51.860 --> 00:19:57.090
As a servant who can't even protect her master, I fail!

00:20:05.280 --> 00:20:06.950
Hayato-dono.

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:07.940
Himawari.

00:20:08.650 --> 00:20:11.950
Even though Hayato looks so bad now, I still cry.

00:20:23.470 --> 00:20:24.400
Hayato-dono!

00:20:24.410 --> 00:20:27.140
Goodbye, Himawari.

00:20:27.150 --> 00:20:28.770
Goodbye!

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:30.870
You're turning back to normal!

00:20:31.920 --> 00:20:33.580
The power of love?

00:20:33.590 --> 00:20:35.370
No, that's not it.

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:38.380
Excuse me.

00:20:41.790 --> 00:20:43.220
Here, Shikimi.

00:20:50.590 --> 00:20:52.200
As I thought.

00:20:52.200 --> 00:20:55.230
I've heard that miso soup can cure aconite poison as well.

00:20:55.850 --> 00:21:00.110
The fermented soy beans can be used to stimulate the antidote.

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:08.680
What do you mean? What's happening?

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:11.750
You've returned back to yourself, Hayato-dono, and Shikimi-san too.

00:21:14.320 --> 00:21:15.750
Wonderful!

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:24.770
This is the handwriting of Principal Yatsugashira.

00:21:25.620 --> 00:21:27.260
Why me?

00:21:30.230 --> 00:21:34.370
It's the duty of a principal to protect the teachers and students.

00:21:34.390 --> 00:21:37.770
It would be faster if you told them directly.

00:21:38.210 --> 00:21:41.610
I haven't seen through all their abilities.

00:21:41.620 --> 00:21:45.210
You had a good time too.

00:21:47.330 --> 00:21:50.790
It's because I'm interested in what will happen to Hayato in the end.

00:21:51.790 --> 00:21:53.990
Then, it's for our mutual interest.

00:21:54.010 --> 00:21:54.770
Yes.

00:22:03.830 --> 00:22:08.770
If I move to the surface, I will get caught by the organization just like the other boys.

00:22:08.790 --> 00:22:12.210
Therefore I will hide in these mountains for a while and keep track of their movements.

00:22:12.220 --> 00:22:13.140
Nanafushi...

00:22:13.150 --> 00:22:16.580
But, I will always be at your side.

00:22:16.600 --> 00:22:18.470
Take care.

00:22:29.220 --> 00:22:33.430
Hayato-dono, thank you for those humble words.

00:22:33.440 --> 00:22:34.700
What do you mean?

00:22:34.700 --> 00:22:40.000
No, no... I couldn't forget their humility as soon as I heard them.

00:22:40.000 --> 00:22:43.870
"Himawari. Thank you for choosing this good-for-nothing master."

00:22:43.890 --> 00:22:46.140
Listen. It's the order from master.

00:22:46.150 --> 00:22:47.490
Don't say it again.

00:22:51.480 --> 00:22:53.880
Are you listening? Hey!

00:22:56.020 --> 00:22:58.120
Hey! Himawari!

00:24:10.780 --> 00:24:13.570
On the night of a full moon, a suspicious shadow flies through the sky.

00:24:13.570 --> 00:24:16.190
Huh, Monjaya is closed?

00:24:16.190 --> 00:24:20.950
But why? I won't be able to eat okonomiyaki again!

00:24:20.960 --> 00:24:24.690
Then, a super-sexy female teacher gets transfered in,

00:24:24.690 --> 00:24:27.450
and goes out a lot with Hayato-dono.

00:24:27.450 --> 00:24:31.750
Is there a 99% chance they'll get married?

00:24:32.260 --> 00:24:33.000
Next time:

00:24:33.000 --> 00:24:35.460
"Blades are not needed to kill a man."

00:24:35.460 --> 00:24:39.080
Hayato-dono, please get away from that woman!
